# Selecting all Colors entries and pressing c3 moves them all under Yellow, and one undo puts each back.
file <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @red
	- Build @green
	- Ship @violet
END
keys gC <C-a> c3
see 󰏘 Yellow
hide Red
hide Violet
keys z
see 󰏘 Violet
quit
saved <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @red
	- Build @green
	- Ship @violet
END
